### ============================================
### MICROSERVICIO SOLICITUDES - Endpoints
### ============================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8084/api
@gatewayUrl = http://localhost:8080/api

### ========== SOLICITUDES ==========

### 1. Listar todas las solicitudes (OPERADOR)
GET {{baseUrl}}/solicitudes
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Crear nueva solicitud (CLIENTE)
POST {{baseUrl}}/solicitudes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clienteId": 1,
  "contenedorId": 1,
  "tarifaId": 1,
  "camionId": 3,
  "fechaCreacion": "2025-11-10",
  "origenDireccion": "Calle 123",
  "destinoDireccion": "Ruta 9 km 500",
  "costoEstimado": 18500.75,
  "estadoId": 1
}

###

### 3. Obtener solicitud por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/solicitudes/1
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Ver seguimiento de solicitud (CLIENTE)
GET {{baseUrl}}/solicitudes/1/seguimiento
Accept: application/json

###

### 5. Asignar ruta a solicitud (OPERADOR)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/solicitudes/1/ruta/1

###
